              "text": "The URL you entered\u2014`mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx`\u2014is a legacy web address formerly used by the **Georgia Department of Revenue (DOR) Motor Vehicle Division (MVD)**. \n\nGeorgia has modernized its motor vehicle systems. If you are looking to renew your license plates (\"tags\"), check status, or explore plate designs, you should use the updated official portals:\n\n### 1. Official Georgia Motor Vehicle Portals\n*   **Georgia DRIVES e-Services (Online Portal):** **[eservices.drives.ga.gov](https://eservices.drives.ga.gov/)**\n    This is the primary self-service portal where you can complete most tag, title, and registration tasks online.\n*   **Georgia DOR Motor Vehicles Homepage:** **[dor.georgia.gov/motor-vehicles](https://dor.georgia.gov/motor-vehicles)**\n    This page hosts general information, guides, forms, and updates regarding Georgia vehicle rules.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Common Tasks You Can Complete Online\nThrough the **Georgia DRIVES** portal, you can:\n*   **Renew Your Tag / Registration:** Keep your decals up-to-date annually.\n*   **Prestige & Specialty Plates:** Browse hundreds of available specialty designs (such as university, military, or hobbyist plates) and check the availability of vanity text.\n*   **Estimate TAVT (Title Ad Valorem Tax):** Calculate taxes due when purchasing or transferring a vehicle.\n*   **Cancel or Reinstated Registration:** Temporarily cancel your registration if a vehicle is sold or stored to avoid insurance lapse penalties.\n*   **Update Your Address:** Change the physical address on your registration.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Alternative Ways to Renew Your Tag\nIf you prefer not to renew online via the portal, you have two other options:\n1.  **Self-Service Kiosks (Georgia MV Express):** You can use a participating kiosk (usually located in local grocery stores like Kroger) to scan your renewal notice, pay, and instantly print your license plate decals in under two minutes.\n2.  **In Person:** Visit your local **County Tag Office** to process your registration and title applications directly.",
